    "title": "Gabe Evans' 'Stop Pills That Kill' Fentanyl Legislation Passes U.S. House - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steven Middendorp ,\n8 hours ago On Tuesday, legislation authored by Congressman Gabe Evans (CO-8) to crack down on production and distribution of counterfeit prescription pills containing fentanyl, fentanyl analogues, methamphetamine, and other substances passed the US House of Representatives. Synthetic opioid overdose deaths decreased by 21% from December 2024 to August 2025 across the country,... Read full article\n4",
